      "content": "exactly. it's just all so heavy. i look at my sword and i just think... if i'm the one who led them to this end, if i'm the reason everything is lost... maybe there is some kind of dignity left in choosing how it all stops. to not let them take me alive like an animal. do you think there's any honor in that?",
